        if defined $call_args->{'args'};
    $data{'session'}{$target_sid}{'buffer'}{'output'}
        .= sprintf "%s\n", $cmd_output;
}
```

This is at line 2132. But wait, this is for `command_mode == 1`. What are the other command modes?

Looking earlier in `base.handler.command`:
